  "details": "It didn't happen to me. Happened to my boyfriend who was trying to find me in VRChat but I thought it would be best to let you guys know about it. \nSo he was gonna surprise me and see me in VRChat when I am not expecting him at all. I was in the world \" Room of the Rain\" but somehow, his friends list, showed him me with the correct name and avatar i was using, that i was in an \" Among Us\" world.\nSo this was really weird because he joined that Among Us world and found ME in the game. With the correct nametag and avatar i was using. But that couldn't be possible because I NEVER LEFT \"ROOM OF THE RAIN\". I was still in Room of the Rain chatting with friends I haven't seen in a log time. But somehow VRChat lied about my location to my boyfriend and was somehow able to pull me into another world and fake my nametag and myself being in that world. \nUnfortunately there's no proof since it did not happen to me but this is still fucked up. Because now i felt so awful for \"ignoring him\" when he came to see me. \nNot sure how VRChat was able to fake my nametag and the avatar I was using into another world but. hopefully this doesn't carry on for anyone else. If i ever see a friend in a world and I go see them and they \"ignore me\" I would think that i was intentionally being ignored and those \"friends\" do not want me. I don't want a weird bug to destroy friendships and relationships for people.",
